06\", \"token_count\": 322, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnable distributed zero-trust node synchronization for multi-site local deployments, requiring an authenticated handshake between nodes. Validation of the handshake under high-latency networks failed with timeouts; the fix depends on the completed encryption work, but the task remains blocked pending resolution.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Authenticated node-replication handshake completes reliably between nodes.\\n\\n- Handshake succeeds under high-latency network conditions, not only nominal latency.\\n\\n- Blocking timeout issue is resolved before multi-site rollout can proceed.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nEnable distributed zero-trust node synchronization for multi-site local deployments, requiring an authenticated handshake between nodes. Validation of the handshake under high-latency networks failed with timeouts; the fix depends on the completed encryption work, but the task remains blocked pending resolution.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-34\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-34\\n\\n**Title**: Authenticated handshake for multi-site node sync\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-04\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-04**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because multi-site local deployments need distributed zero-trust node synchronization.*\\n\\n- **2026-09-22**: Diana - Handshake Timeout Block (Blocked)\\n\\n - *Blocked after validation showed handshake timeouts on high-latency networks; resolution depends on the encryption work but remains unresolved.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript enabl distribut zero trust node synchron for multi site local deploy requir an authent handshak between node valid of the handshak under high latenc network fail with timeout the fix depend on the complet encrypt work but the task remain block pend resolut clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 accept criterion authent node replic handshak complet reliabl between node handshak succeed under high latenc network condit not onli nomin latenc block timeout issu is resolv befor multi site rollout can proceed clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 descript enabl distribut zero trust node synchron for multi site local deploy requir an authent handshak between node valid of the handshak under high latenc network fail with timeout the fix depend on the complet encrypt work but the task remain block pend resolut clickup task ciph 34 sourc id src cu ciph 34 task id ciph 34 titl authent handshak for multi site node sync status block assigne bob prioriti high date creat 2026 08 04 activ histori 2026 08 04 alic task creat open open the task becaus multi site local deploy need distribut zero trust node synchron 2026 09 22 diana handshak timeout block block block after valid show handshak timeout on high latenc network resolut depend on the encrypt work but remain unresolv\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e993c5728a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"id\": \"d487d4d51c3b088f\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.29482122608615935, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11158002012308482, \"vector_similarity\": 0.72238404, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e993c5728a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-34-Zero-Trust-Node-Sync.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1197, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:05\", \"token_count\": 534, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Test Logs\\n\\nReproduction notes for the high-DPI coordinate misalignment reported for CIPH-46, first reproduced 2026-08-17.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Repro steps\\n\\n1. Open a PDF on a display reporting a scale factor above 1.0 (tested at 150% and 200%).\\n\\n2. Compare the redaction preview overlay's reported box coordinates against the coordinates the rendering library reports for the same region.\\n\\n3. At scale factors above 1.0, the overlay box is offset from the actual text region, with the offset growing as scale factor increases.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nThe misalignment reproduces consistently at both tested scale factors. It does not reproduce at 100% scale.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nRoot cause has not been isolated as part of this reproduction pass; this note only establishes that the defect reproduces and under which display conditions.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 test log reproduct note for the high dpi coordin misalign report for ciph 46 first reproduc 2026 08 17 sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 repro step 1 open a pdf on a display report a scale factor abov 10 test at 150 and 200 2 compar the redact preview overlay s report box coordin against the coordin the render librari report for the same region 3 at scale factor abov 10 the overlay box is offset from the actual text region with the offset grow a scale factor increas sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 result the misalign reproduc consist at both test scale factor it doe not reproduc at 100 scale sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 status root caus ha not been isol a part of this reproduct pas this note onli establish that the defect reproduc and under which display condit\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"id\": \"a55699b32432c8bc\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2938660550805186, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10664994297216944, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73070365, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 987, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:58\", \"token_count\": 453, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {\"question\": \"as of 2026-09-22 unfinished audit implementation items audit log crash reporting task OCR cleanup manual review threshold CIPH\", \"similarity_threshold\": 0.2, \"vector_weight\": 0.3, \"keyword_search\": false, \"dataset_count\": 1}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"co